# ---------- check-rainbow-title-areas (wave-69) ----------
# Trigger: any change in the 22 wave-65-tracked component trees, or the script
# itself. Same tracked-area set as wave-65/67/68 by design.
# Mechanic: ratchets the v22 §10 banned rainbow text-clip title pattern per
# area at the measured floor at lock time (HEAD b7408593). Counts any line
